GhostLock HONOR

This project is a derivative fork of YuKongA/ghostlock-app:
https://github.com/YuKongA/ghostlock-app
Upstream revision: 437b3b257462e17d395cfd2cd8fb81536d6c6358

The native runtime originates from that revision. Changes include a consumer
stop acknowledgement fix and reproducible source-path mapping. The Android
application adds HONOR-specific configuration, two explicit recovery paths,
initialization, operation history and owner-requested marker reset.

